        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift, Nathan Chapman\n- Songs: White Horse, Teardrops on My Guitar, You Belong with Me, Picture to Burn, Fifteen\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Albums: Fearless\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- Liz Rose has co-written twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- \"White Horse\" was released on December 7, 2008, by Big Machine Records as the second single from Taylor Swift's second studio album, \"Fearless\" (2008).\n- Liz Rose and Taylor Swift won a Grammy Award in 2010 for \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- \"Picture to Burn\" was co-written by Taylor Swift and Liz Rose, and it was produced by Nathan Chapman.\n- \"Fifteen\" is a country pop song performed by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift.",
